1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,770
Blob and his two neighbours

2
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:03,770
lose everything overnight.

3
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:05,990
Money, houses, fields.

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,210
All gone.

5
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:08,870
Three hungry days later,

6
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:10,910
each of them gets one chicken.

7
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,060
The first neighbour cooks his

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,120
right away.

9
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:15,060
Best dinner in days.

10
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,670
Also his last.

11
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,145
The second neighbour gets a hen

12
00:00:18,185 --> 00:00:20,420
and eats one egg every morning.

13
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:21,850
Blob gets a rooster.

14
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:23,200
No eggs at all.

15
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:24,405
So he knocks on her door

16
00:00:24,445 --> 00:00:25,470
with a deal.

17
00:00:25,510 --> 00:00:27,370
Let my rooster meet your hen,

18
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,930
and I'll share the eggs.

19
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,170
She wanted eggs.

20
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:32,010
Blob wanted chicks.

21
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:32,820
Three weeks later,

22
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,530
the first chicks hatch.

23
00:00:34,570 --> 00:00:36,110
About five months after that,

24
00:00:36,150 --> 00:00:37,630
they're laying eggs too.

25
00:00:37,670 --> 00:00:39,540
Blob's yard fills up so fast

26
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:40,810
he can't keep up,

27
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,390
so he hires the first neighbour

28
00:00:42,430 --> 00:00:44,190
and pays him in eggs.

29
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,090
Same start.

30
00:00:45,130 --> 00:00:46,190
Same chicken.

31
00:00:46,230 --> 00:00:47,550
Now one is poor,

32
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:48,680
one is comfortable,

33
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,400
and one is rich.

34
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,610
Subscribe so you don't miss

35
00:00:51,650 --> 00:00:53,380
Blob's next lesson.
